# {{.Global.Config.PackageName}} Examples

This directory contains example scripts demonstrating how to use the {{.Global.Config.PackageName}} SDK.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js (v18 or higher)
- npm

## Setup

1. Copy `.env.template` to `.env`:
   ```bash
   cp .env.template .env
   ```

2. Edit `.env` and add your actual credentials{{if .Global.Config.EnvVarPrefix}} (API keys, tokens, etc.){{end}}

## Running the Examples

To run an example file from the examples directory:

```bash
npm run build && npx tsx example.ts
```

## Creating new examples

Duplicate an existing example file, they won't be overwritten by the generation process.


